---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Cta from "../components/Cta.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <section class="page__hero" aria-labelledby="page-heading">
      <h1 id="page-heading" class="page__heading">About</h1>
      <p class="about__subheading">
        “Reliable Solar Services for Homes & Businesses”
      </p>
      <p>
        We help homeowners and businesses get the most from their solar systems
        through professional installations, panel cleaning, and bird-proofing
        solutions. Our focus is simple: reliable workmanship, honest service,
        and long-term solar performance.
      </p>
      <div class="about">
        <h2 class="page__subheading">Who We Are</h2>
        <p>
          At Solar360 Energy, we’re passionate about helping property owners
          across Cyprus benefit from reliable and efficient solar energy
          solutions. With a strong focus on quality service and long-term
          customer satisfaction, we provide practical solar services designed to
          protect your investment and maximise system performance.
        </p>
        <h2 class="page__subheading">What We Do</h2>
        <p>
          We specialise in solar panel installations, professional panel
          cleaning, and solar bird proofing for residential and commercial
          properties. Whether you’re looking to install a brand-new solar
          system, improve energy efficiency through regular maintenance, or
          protect your panels from bird-related damage, our team delivers
          dependable solutions tailored to your needs.
        </p>
        <h2 class="page__subheading">Our Approach</h2>
        <p>
          We believe solar services should be straightforward, transparent, and
          built around long-term value. From the first enquiry to project
          completion, we focus on clear communication, professional workmanship,
          and reliable support. Using trusted materials and industry-approved
          methods, we ensure every job is completed safely and to a high
          standard.
        </p>
        <h2 class="page__subheading">Why Customers Trust Us</h2>
        <p>
          Customers choose Solar360 Energy because we combine expert knowledge
          with honest, customer-focused service. We take pride in delivering
          reliable results, responding quickly to enquiries, and helping
          homeowners and businesses across Cyprus keep their solar systems
          operating at their best.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <Cta />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
